WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.538
Yʋʋm kob-gĩnd 19 wã saabẽ wã, Waagadougou soolmã ra yaa Mozi soolmã sẽn da tar pãng n yɩɩda.

00:00:08.618 --> 00:00:14.439
A Moog Naaba, Moog rĩmã, sẽn yaa Mozi tẽngã, n da soog a Naamã.

00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:19.778
Wakat kãnga, Naaba Wobgo n da boond-a t'a Boukary Koutou.

00:00:19.858 --> 00:00:24.930
Wakat kãng la Erop pãn-soaadbã ra zabd ne Afirik Wɛtgã.

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:35.140
A Frans sodaasã ra kẽnda tẽns a taab pʋsẽ n baood n na n kɩt tɩ soolem nins b sẽn da yã wã tõog n dɩ b naamã.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:41.415
A Moogã Naaba zãgsame n na n kɩt t'a rĩungã zĩnd a nin-buiidã nugẽ.

00:00:41.495 --> 00:00:47.597
Yʋʋmd 1896 wã, Frans tãb-biis kẽer kẽnga Ouagadougou n deeg tẽngã.

00:00:47.677 --> 00:00:50.127
A Naaba Wobgo basa a roogã.

00:00:50.207 --> 00:00:54.435
B wilgame t'a ra pa tõog n le soog a naamã ye.

00:00:54.515 --> 00:00:58.650
Frans nebã yãka rĩm a to t'a wa soog a naamã.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:09.235
A Naaba Wobgo me kẽnga zĩ-gõonegẽ, n kẽng Britãnsã soolmẽ wã, la a wa n kell n yɩɩ yembdo, n zãag ne Ouagadougou.

00:01:09.315 --> 00:01:22.161
Burkĩna neb wʋsg nifẽ, Naaba Wobgo lebga rĩmã mak-sõngo: rĩmã sẽn yãk yam n na n menes a roogã n yɩɩd t'a sak sãnda naam n pa zab ne-a ye.

00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:30.217
B tẽegda yẽ yell Ouagadougou, la b togsd-a-la kom-bɩɩsã tɩ b zãms-b tɩ b tall waoogre.

00:01:30.297 --> 00:01:40.708
Kibis-mitbã ket n vaeesda wakat kãngã, b sẽn tũnugd ne kolone rãmbã sɛb la b sẽn da yet tɩ rĩm-dãmbã tara noorã.

00:01:40.788 --> 00:01:52.510
Sẽn paase, b sẽn da wa n gomd bũmb ning b sẽn maan to-to wã pa yembr ye, la yaa vẽeneg tɩ a Ouagadougou pa sak n sak n bas ye.
